# VaidyaSetu product material — lives in the private `vaidyasetu` repo, never here.
# This repository is PUBLIC. `docs/vaidyasetu/portal-src/portal-inner.html` is the
# plaintext of the investor deck that `03-INVESTOR-PORTAL.html` encrypts, so
# committing it here would publish the thing the password gate exists to protect
# and make the gate decorative. The build plan carries pricing and acquisition
# strategy and is treated the same way. Both are kept on disk and tracked in the
# fork (doc 26 §1).
docs/vaidyasetu/
docs/26-VAIDYASETU-BUILD-PLAN.md
